Description: Add grouped, detailed, and filter options from G-dH/smem
 Port the report and filter switches that are not specific to the smem2
 rewrite: -g/--groupcmd, -b/--basename, -T/--totalsonly, -i/--ignorecase,
 -W/--sysdetail, -q/--quiet, and --pid. -c accepts "all" and a leading
 "+" to append columns. Process filters match pid, comm, and command,
 and a live -P report skips smem itself. The system view can use
 dmidecode for installed RAM and -W splits kernel and cache use,
 including the /dev/zero mapping adjustment. -q silences warnings.
 JSON output and the smem2 packaging rewrite are intentionally not included.
Origin: https://github.com/G-dH/smem
Forwarded: no
Author: Hualet Wang <mr.asianwang@gmail.com>

